    "detailed_description": "Play a fast, dynamic, cyberpunk rythm game ! <br><br>Retis Tormentum Corporation is a big company using human's brain to power up a giant computer.<br>You live in this dystopian world, raising your child alone.<br>But one day, unable to find a job, your only solution is to apply to Retis Tormentum Corporation's program.<br><br>Work hard. Don't die. Your speed is your only means of survival in the cyberspace.<br><br><strong>The game is actually in Alpha.</strong><br><br>Keep hope alive and maybe you will escape. <br><br><br><br><br>Level 1 and Level 1 hard mode playable.<br><br>What will come in further updates :<br>- 2 more levels (both with story and infinity mode). <br>-6 soundtracks (one for each level with an alternative).<br>-You will be able to find a way to escape the corporation in 2nd and 3rd levels.<br>-The game will be translated in french.<br>-A different art for Conclusion.<br>-And of course... The juice !",
